Description: wlrandr: add WLRANDR_3 with a monitor id and the primary monitor
 The display capplet needs to set the primary monitor and to know which monitor
 is which on Wayland. WLRANDR_3 adds the monitor id and the primary to the
 D-Bus interface. The old versions still work the same.
Origin: https://github.com/mate-desktop/mate-settings-daemon/pull/452
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-22

